    <string name="chat_support_name">Thušo ya CloudDesk</string>
    <string name="chat_greeting_format">Thobela %1$s! 👋 Ke mothuši wa gago wa thušo wa CloudDesk. Mpotše seo o lebanago le sona gomme ke tla go thuša, goba ke go lebiša go sehlopha se se swanetšego.</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_login">Bakeng sa mathata a go tsena, leka link ya \'Forgot Password\' pele letlakaleng la go tsena. Ge seo se sa šome, nka hlama kgato bakeng sa sehlopha sa rena sa Auth — a o nyaka ke dira bjalo?</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_urgent">Seo se bonagala e le bohlokwa — nka šišinya gore o romele kgato gatee-tee gore e lebelwe e le ya bohlokwa ka go itiragalela. Ke tla bitša motheknišiene gape bjale.</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_ticket_status">O ka hlahloba boemo bja kgato le ge e le efe go tloga go letlakala la gago la taolo — tobetša go yona go bona diphetogo le ditlhahlobo tša morago-rago. Na o na le nomoro ya kgato?</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_thanks">Ga se selo! Ntsebiše ge go na le se sengwe gape.</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_greeting">Thobela! Nka go thuša bjang lehono?</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_default">Go lokile, ke a leboga ka dintlha. Motheknišiene o tla go ikgokaganya le wena ka pela. Ka nako yeo, romela kgato go tšwa go letlakala la taolo gore re kgone go e lekolla gabotse.</string>

